"content": "<h1>謝拉（Zara, Zarah）</h1><p>某英文譯本在<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen38:30\">創世記三十八章30節</a>，<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Gen46:12\">四十六章12節</a>和<a href=\"https://ref.ly/Matt1:3\">馬太福音一章3節</a>將猶大的兒子謝拉（Zerah）拼成Zara和Zarah。</p><p><em>見</em> <span data-bnType=\"resourceReference\" data-resourceId=\"8358\" data-resourceType=\"TyndaleBibleDictionary\">謝拉2</span>。</p>",
